          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>This choropleth map deepens our geographic analysis by using color density to represent customer volume by State.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Darker green shades point to higher customer concentrations, revealing regional clusters of engagement.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Most customers are concentrated in the West coast, mainly in California</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
