          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>This story highlights several critical insights:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>
— Customer distribution varies significantly across States, with clear regional clusters.
— Higher-income customers do not necessarily generate higher lifetime value.
— Claim behavior varies by vehicle size, with notable outliers that merit deeper investigation.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>
Together, these insights provide actionable opportunities for customer targeting, geographic expansion, and risk management optimization.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
